    <comment>Under "GPU overclock" while no offsets are set in the operating mode in force.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="GpuClocks_WaitingForLimits" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>I limiti della GPU compaiono dopo che è stata usata.</value>
    <comment>Under "GPU overclock" until the NVIDIA driver has reported which offsets it accepts (it is only asked while the GPU is on).</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="GpuClocks_Pending" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Si applica la prossima volta che la GPU viene usata.</value>
    <comment>Under "GPU overclock" while offsets are set but the GPU is powered down (it is not woken to apply them).</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="GpuClocks_Applied" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>In uso: core {0} MHz, memoria {1} MHz</value>
    <comment>Under "GPU overclock": the offsets in force. {0} = core, {1} = memory offset, with their sign (e.g. +150, 0).</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="GpuClocks_NotApplied" xml:space="preserve">
